      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Hey everyone!\n\nI found the old Google Sheet character builder made by Justin Wawrzonek AKA drevilz4l AKA Beeromancer Macduff, and I gave it a massive upgrade!\n\nHe encouraged me to share it here. :slight_smile: \n\nIt has a campaign (collection) planner, with Hero character builder and output sheet. Villain builder, collection planner, scene planner, notes sections, and rules quick ref (including some a house rule clarification regarding \"remove penalty\" type abilities).\n\nThere's a few formatting quirks and type-o's I may have missed.\n\nJust like Beeromancer's original, create a copy of the sheet and save it to your Google sheets, and edit as needed.\n\n[SCRPG Ultimate Collection Planner Template](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/10iL3chpFToog3AcTpfCs2ppDpG06AyicTQqX6x1_lDw/edit?usp=sharing)",
